          "title": "Paranoia Mandatory Bonus Fun Card Game",
          "subtitle": "Social",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Paranoia Mandatory Bonus Fun Card Game is a commercial card game based on the Paranoia role-playing game setting."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Published by Mongoose Publishing in 2005, it adapts the Alpha Complex world of Paranoia into a custom card game with secretive and hostile player interaction."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Setup",
          "subtitle": "Table, deck, equipment, and deal",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "3 or more players use the table arrangement described for Paranoia Mandatory Bonus Fun Card Game."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Dedicated Paranoia card game deck"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Dedicated Paranoia card game deck, score area, and enough table space for play."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Prepare the dedicated Paranoia Mandatory Bonus Fun Card Game cards and any shared table, score, or resource areas from the published rules."
